<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:clamp(.78rem,1vw,.95rem);font-weight:400\">FREE from EUR 60 order value</span></span></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f60b07ba-113c-4c02-90f4-8d16849d386a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2 style=\"margin-top:0 !important\">Safe arrival of your accessory</h2><h2>Care all the way to your door</h2><p>To make sure your chosen accessory reaches you in perfect condition, we place great value on a reliable shipping process. We ship our high-quality shoelaces securely packed to protect the look and structure created by the traditional waxing until they arrive at your shoe. Careful inspection: before shipping, every lace is checked for its shape-retaining quality and surface finish. Transparent delivery: we work with proven shipping partners to ensure reliable and punctual delivery. <strong>Shipping costs</strong>: you will find the exact conditions for domestic and international shipping clearly listed further down this page.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0}],"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"e8ce5fa9-1ba1-49d4-98e2-e31c0de68230","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2 style=\"margin:12px 0 16px !important;padding:8px 16px;background:#d6d3cd;color:#121212;font-size:1.35rem !important;line-height:1.25 !important\">Domestic shipping DE</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>FREE from EUR 35 order value</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">DEUTSCHE POST LETTER EUR 1.49 (up to 4 pairs)</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">DHL SMALL PARCEL incl. tracking EUR 4.99 (from 5 pairs)</p><h2 style=\"margin:28px 0 16px !important;padding:8px 16px;background:#d6d3cd;color:#121212;font-size:1.35rem !important;line-height:1.25 !important\">International shipping – DHL EU ZONE</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>FREE from EUR 50 order value</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">DHL WARENPOST International incl. tracking EUR 7.99</p><p>Austria, Belgium, Cyprus, Czech Republic, Denmark, Spain, Estonia, France, Finland, United Kingdom, Greece, Hungary, Italy, Ireland, Luxembourg, Malta, Norway, Netherlands, Portugal, Poland, Sweden, Slovakia, Liechtenstein, Monaco, Croatia.</p><h2 style=\"margin:28px 0 16px !important;padding:8px 16px;background:#d6d3cd;color:#121212;font-size:1.35rem !important;line-height:1.25 !important\">International shipping – DHL WORLD ZONE</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"><strong>FREE from EUR 60 order value</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">DHL WARENPOST International incl. tracking EUR 8.99</p><p>All other countries. Warenpost incl. tracking and proof of delivery (Excluding the USA due to the executive order “Suspending Duty-Free De Minimis Treatment for All Countries”.)</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"9c40cd6a-9ee6-4f6f-8e32-114ae7ccfdfa","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"laccico-listenkopf\"><h2>Shape & Diameter</h2><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter\">» View all</a></div>","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"727","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}}},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"30b53d29-d53c-4d3f-8487-b5e7d3d035df","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"ht